1
00:00:01,320 --> 00:00:03,560
Xu Feiyu.

2
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:08,760
Xu Feiyu!

3
00:00:10,520 --> 00:00:11,640
Xu Feiyu!

4
00:00:13,320 --> 00:00:15,000
Xu Feiyu!

5
00:00:15,320 --> 00:00:16,680
Where did you go, Xu Feiyu!

6
00:00:18,080 --> 00:00:19,560
Xu Feiyu!

7
00:00:59,520 --> 00:01:01,120
Stop looking.

8
00:01:01,720 --> 00:01:02,920
He hasn't been back here.

9
00:01:07,280 --> 00:01:09,519
Were you seeing things just now?

10
00:01:09,520 --> 00:01:11,520
Charging out like a lunatic.

11
00:01:13,600 --> 00:01:14,880
Sorry.

12
00:01:15,400 --> 00:01:17,400
Just now I kind of lost it.

13
00:01:20,680 --> 00:01:22,480
Your head's full of Xu Feiyu, huh?

14
00:01:23,120 --> 00:01:24,880
Don't tease me.

15
00:01:25,600 --> 00:01:26,600
Oh right.

16
00:01:26,760 --> 00:01:27,760
Is dinner ready?

17
00:01:28,720 --> 00:01:30,240
What dinner?

18
00:01:30,800 --> 00:01:32,039
You came here

19
00:01:32,040 --> 00:01:33,120
to cook, didn't you?

20
00:01:34,400 --> 00:01:37,119
I only came by to check on things

21
00:01:37,120 --> 00:01:39,400
so you don't burn down
Mr. Song's studio too.

22
00:01:45,720 --> 00:01:47,040
Senior.

23
00:01:47,440 --> 00:01:48,440
I'm hungry.

24
00:01:53,680 --> 00:01:57,200
Every one of you gives me a head ache.

25
00:02:00,120 --> 00:02:01,520
I'll make you noodles!

26
00:02:02,120 --> 00:02:03,120
Yes!

27
00:02:03,160 --> 00:02:04,160
Thanks, Senior.

28
00:02:07,520 --> 00:02:08,520
Song Yi.

29
00:02:09,320 --> 00:02:09,880
Hm?

30
00:02:10,040 --> 00:02:11,760
Don't tell me you're living here?

31
00:02:12,720 --> 00:02:13,720
Don't worry.

32
00:02:13,800 --> 00:02:14,800
I'm not staying here.

33
00:02:17,280 --> 00:02:18,760
I've got a better place.

34
00:03:20,920 --> 00:03:21,920
Thank you.

35
00:04:14,880 --> 00:04:15,880
Hey.

36
00:04:16,120 --> 00:04:17,520
There he is, the great author.

37
00:04:18,320 --> 00:04:19,160
Ah.

38
00:04:19,161 --> 00:04:20,200
Comic artist, I mean.

39
00:04:20,480 --> 00:04:21,280
The usual.

40
00:04:21,280 --> 00:04:22,280
Here.

41
00:04:22,880 --> 00:04:23,880
Thanks.

42
00:04:39,320 --> 00:04:40,440
Are you here alone?

43
00:04:48,600 --> 00:04:50,400
I think I've seen you in my elevator.

44
00:04:51,240 --> 00:04:52,240
Did you just move in?

45
00:04:55,480 --> 00:04:56,480
Mm.

46
00:04:57,840 --> 00:04:59,200
This bar isn't close by.

47
00:04:59,680 --> 00:05:01,240
Why come so far just to drink?

48
00:05:06,240 --> 00:05:07,960
Why have you not said a word?

49
00:05:08,560 --> 00:05:09,160
Perhaps

50
00:05:09,320 --> 00:05:10,320
you cannot speak?

51
00:05:12,920 --> 00:05:14,400
Then let's have a drink.

52
00:05:25,440 --> 00:05:27,519
Since you do not care for conversation

53
00:05:27,520 --> 00:05:28,760
then let's just drink.

54
00:05:37,440 --> 00:05:39,359
Do you know why I always come this far

55
00:05:39,360 --> 00:05:40,360
to get to this bar?

56
00:05:44,760 --> 00:05:45,320
As I recall

57
00:05:45,321 --> 00:05:47,480
the first time I came to this bar

58
00:05:47,760 --> 00:05:48,880
was nine months ago.

59
00:05:50,520 --> 00:05:53,126
I'm embarrassed to say
someone brought me here.

60
00:05:55,440 --> 00:05:57,440
At the time I had just had eye surgery

61
00:05:57,920 --> 00:05:58,920
wrapped in bandages

62
00:05:59,280 --> 00:06:00,480
I couldn't see a thing.

63
00:06:01,680 --> 00:06:02,680
So

64
00:06:02,720 --> 00:06:04,560
I had no idea which bar it was.

65
00:06:08,160 --> 00:06:09,960
Are you curious how I found it?

66
00:06:10,680 --> 00:06:11,680
Mm.

67
00:06:12,840 --> 00:06:14,280
Then let's have a drink first.

68
00:06:17,920 --> 00:06:18,920
Bottoms up.

69
00:06:29,280 --> 00:06:30,400
Actually

70
00:06:30,880 --> 00:06:31,920
it was very simple.

71
00:06:33,320 --> 00:06:35,440
The person who brought me was dancing

72
00:06:36,480 --> 00:06:38,160
and there were lots of young women.

73
00:06:38,640 --> 00:06:39,640
Around here

74
00:06:40,200 --> 00:06:42,080
this is the only bar people can dance at.

75
00:06:46,080 --> 00:06:46,640
Excuse me.

76
00:06:46,960 --> 00:06:47,960
Coming.

77
00:06:48,200 --> 00:06:49,800
Bring the bottle I left last time.

78
00:06:50,080 --> 00:06:51,080
Yes.

79
00:06:53,680 --> 00:06:54,040
Well

80
00:06:54,560 --> 00:06:56,000
you might not like talking

81
00:06:56,480 --> 00:06:57,520
but surely you drink.

82
00:06:57,920 --> 00:06:58,920
Here you are.

83
00:06:59,720 --> 00:07:00,720
Thank you.

84
00:07:08,880 --> 00:07:10,120
To be honest

85
00:07:11,440 --> 00:07:13,080
you remind me of someone.

86
00:07:18,240 --> 00:07:19,960
But it is only a resemblance.

87
00:07:31,040 --> 00:07:32,920
A resemblance is all it can ever be.

88
00:07:34,040 --> 00:07:35,040
Because

89
00:07:36,800 --> 00:07:38,400
he is never coming back.

90
00:07:42,640 --> 00:07:43,800
Don't misunderstand me.

91
00:07:44,160 --> 00:07:45,400
He left this place.

92
00:07:46,320 --> 00:07:47,320
He was

93
00:07:49,160 --> 00:07:50,320
like a phantom.

94
00:08:05,280 --> 00:08:06,280
I suppose

95
00:08:08,880 --> 00:08:10,080
he will not be coming back.

96
00:08:18,640 --> 00:08:20,760
How embarrassing. I apologize.

97
00:08:22,480 --> 00:08:24,720
I don't know why I
am telling you all this.

98
00:08:25,480 --> 00:08:26,480
Maybe

99
00:08:28,320 --> 00:08:29,960
you just remind me of him.

100
00:11:25,880 --> 00:11:27,400
Song Yi...

101
00:11:37,840 --> 00:11:39,160
Song... Yi.

102
00:11:41,240 --> 00:11:42,360
Song... Yi.

103
00:11:46,280 --> 00:11:47,400
Song... Yi.

104
00:11:50,400 --> 00:11:51,480
Song... Yi.

105
00:12:20,760 --> 00:12:21,760
Xu Feiyu.

106
00:12:23,080 --> 00:12:24,360
I'm back,

107
00:12:24,760 --> 00:12:25,960
I came back long ago.

108
00:12:27,600 --> 00:12:29,040
But the promise I made to your mom,

109
00:12:29,800 --> 00:12:30,920
like a thorn,

110
00:12:32,120 --> 00:12:33,520
pricks me every time I remember.

111
00:12:34,473 --> 00:12:36,200
I never knew how to bring it up.

112
00:12:37,800 --> 00:12:39,120
Actually, your aunt was the same—

113
00:12:39,160 --> 00:12:41,120
she knew the life and joy she wanted.

114
00:12:41,800 --> 00:12:43,120
That's why she took the leap—

115
00:12:44,560 --> 00:12:46,160
to seek it out and fight for it.

116
00:12:47,280 --> 00:12:48,880
Time can make us forget everything.

117
00:12:50,560 --> 00:12:52,080
But it can hold on to everything, too.

118
00:14:13,920 --> 00:14:15,000
You?

119
00:14:15,520 --> 00:14:16,560
You're up.

120
00:14:22,320 --> 00:14:23,320
Hm?

121
00:14:28,120 --> 00:14:29,120
Song Yi.

122
00:14:31,080 --> 00:14:31,600
What's wrong?

123
00:14:31,880 --> 00:14:32,880
Go on, eat.

124
00:14:34,320 --> 00:14:35,800
He's Song Yi.

125
00:14:35,840 --> 00:14:36,840
Oh.

126
00:14:43,040 --> 00:14:44,040
You got drunk last night

127
00:14:44,360 --> 00:14:45,360
after I got you home

128
00:14:45,400 --> 00:14:46,720
the drinks hit me too

129
00:14:46,920 --> 00:14:48,440
so I passed out on the couch.

130
00:14:51,320 --> 00:14:52,600
So you...

131
00:14:53,360 --> 00:14:54,360
Oh.

132
00:14:54,480 --> 00:14:55,480
Breakfast, right

133
00:14:55,720 --> 00:14:56,480
I woke up early

134
00:14:56,640 --> 00:14:57,240
so

135
00:14:57,240 --> 00:14:58,240
I just made some.

136
00:15:00,120 --> 00:15:01,960
I remember last night

137
00:15:02,720 --> 00:15:03,920
you didn't say a word.

138
00:15:04,480 --> 00:15:05,520
I thought you were...

139
00:15:06,880 --> 00:15:07,880
Here

140
00:15:08,200 --> 00:15:09,200
let's eat breakfast.

141
00:15:12,240 --> 00:15:13,240
Mm.

142
00:15:20,440 --> 00:15:21,440
Eat up
